<title>MEXICO: New Mexico livestock export update to Mexico - USDA.</title>
<headline>New Mexico livestock export update to Mexico - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly livestock movement update of New Mexico exports to Mexico, to Dec 31 - USDA.</p>
<p>(Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year)</p>
<p>	Beef cattle		Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
